# ─── AI Agent Ignore ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Prevents AI coding tools from scanning large generated/binary
# directories, saving tokens and API limits.
# Supported by: Antigravity, Gemini Code Assist, Cursor, Copilot, etc.

# Rust build artifacts (24 GB+)
.artifacts/
target/
src/target/
src/zed-ods-lsp/target/

# Node dependencies (196 MB, ~14k files)
node_modules/

# Git internals
.git/

# Lock files (large, not useful for AI context)
Cargo.lock
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Binary / compiled outputs
*.wasm
*.bin
*.dat
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Archive plan docs (historical, rarely needed)
docs/plan/archive/

# OKF full spec (37 KB — agent should read only when explicitly needed)
# docs/other-specs/okf-0.2.md
